			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 730090901,
					"content": "About \"Marana\"...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730090902
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730090902,
					"content": "That's a story from very long ago...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730090903
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Araja"
				},
				{
					"id": 730090903,
					"content": "A long time ago, Aranara walked the earth and made friends with Nara and all living creatures. There was no Marana then. Until a disaster that occurred many, many moons ago...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730090904
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Araja"
				},
				{
					"id": 730090904,
					"content": "Greater Lord Rukkhadevata returned to Sarva, and the Marana's rampage through the earth began. Once the forest recovered its vitality, the Aranara hid the real Vanarana in a dream to protect themselves.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730090905
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Araja"
				},
				{
					"id": 730090905,
					"content": "The forest didn't know death, until a day came when the trees realized that withered flowers and dead animals covered the earth.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730090906
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Araja"
				},
				{
					"id": 730090906,
					"content": "On the same day, the earth remembered the dark, poisonous blood it had once devoured, or was about to devour. The rivers thought of the descent of the sun, evaporating all water and leaving a red world behind.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730090907
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Araja"
				},
				{
					"id": 730090907,
					"content": "They realized that all things would meet their end, and so, Marana was born. It is the name of death, and those who know it shall die.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730090908
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Araja"
				},
				{
					"id": 730090908,
					"content": "Marana urges everything towards death. As for the tall, dark, and warped beings, they are the avatars chosen by Marana, the heralds of death.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730090909
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Araja"
				},
				{
					"id": 730090909,
					"content": "Of course. In my stories, Marana's Avatar takes many forms. Sometimes beasts, sometimes birds, sometimes Nara, sometimes blight...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730090910
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Araja"
				},
				{
					"id": 730090910,
					"content": "But stories are just stories, and they aren't my memories.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Araja"
				}
			]
		},
